# Future PS1 avatar and Blender rig

Status: NOT_STARTED
Milestone: M2 - deferred
Dependencies: 07_LIVE_CAMERA_QUALIFICATION.todo

## Purpose
Later create an original PS1-style whole-body avatar in Blender and animate its rig from Python.

## Tasks
- [ ] Agree art direction, silhouette, polygon/texture budget and expression vocabulary.
- [ ] Define skeleton axes, rest pose, bone names, facial morph/shape-key mappings and export format.
- [ ] Create/edit an original .blend, retain source/provenance and validate independent exports.
- [ ] Retarget normalized tracking with calibration, IK, contacts and unobserved-limb policy.
- [ ] Evaluate renderers and depth sources based on measured results, not inherited constraints.

